message: "If you use this case study, please cite it as below."
title: "Duolun Road Community Renewal: a 2026 field case from Shanghai"
abstract: >-
  A field case study of urban renewal and community placemaking on Duolun Road,
  a 550-metre historic street in Hongkou District, Shanghai, designated a
  "Culture Celebrity Street" in 1999 and left largely untouched for nearly three
  decades. Documents a five-phase method (ice-breaking, diagnosis, emergence,
  integration, cultivation), the mechanisms that connected fragmented property
  and merchant interests to a renewal pipeline, six public activities, and the
  finding that media coverage did not translate into public discussion.
type: report
